graph TD
    classDef read fill:#0369A1,stroke:#38BDF8,stroke-width:2px,color:#F0F9FF
    classDef write fill:#7F1D1D,stroke:#F87171,stroke-width:2px,color:#FEF2F2
    classDef neutral fill:#1E293B,stroke:#64748B,stroke-width:2px,color:#F8FAFC

    Agent[Agent / Model]:::neutral
    
    subgraph Autonomous
        direction TB
        R1[read_ticket]:::read
        R2[read_billing]:::read
        R3[read_transactions]:::read
        R4[read_policy]:::read
    end

    subgraph Gated
        direction TB
        W1[issue_refund]:::write
        W2[cancel_subscription]:::write
    end
    
    Agent -->|Always Allowed| Autonomous
    Agent -->|Blocked by Default| Gated
    
    Approval[Human/Policy Approval]:::neutral -->|Grants 1-time execution token| Gated
